    "files": [
      {
        "description": "This CSV file contains  field data collected in 2022 from two forested areas (Veluwe, Netherlands). Insects were trapped and collected from light traps emitting at different light colors and intensities during the night. Each night a total of 24 traps were placed. Traps consisted out of buckets with custom made narrowband LED lights. In total four light colors were tested: UV, Blue, Green, Red; with each color three intensities in two replicates. Insects were collected during 11 nights at two sites between July and September 2022",
        "label": "20250206_Insect_Phototaxis_data_2022_dataverse.csv",
